# Official abseil checkout inside the webrtc fork: used as the Bazel module abseil-cpp (MODULE.bazel).
third-party/webrtc/webrtc/third_party/abseil-cpp
# crc32c's own nested checkouts (googletest, glog, benchmark) that `git submodule update --init --recursive` brings in
# with the webrtc fork: they carry BUILD.bazel/MODULE.bazel files that no target here uses.
third-party/webrtc/webrtc/third_party/crc32c/src/third_party/benchmark
third-party/webrtc/webrtc/third_party/crc32c/src/third_party/glog
third-party/webrtc/webrtc/third_party/crc32c/src/third_party/googletest
# The QuickJS nested in the widget-sandbox fork (packages/ios/Sources/CQuickJS/quickjs) is the same commit as our own
# third-party/quickjs-ng/quickjs pin and must stay equal to it (shared/shared-libraries.json); only ours is built.
third-party/widget-sandbox/widget-sandbox/packages/ios/Sources/CQuickJS/quickjs
